99%A8%E8%87%AA%E9%80%89%E7%AE%B1%3C%2Fa%3E%E5%85%91%E6%8D%A2%E8%8E%B7%E5%BE%97%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D%2C%7B%22key%22%3A%22%E7%BD%AE%E6%8D%A2%E7%A9%BA%E9%97%B4%22%2C%22value%22%3A%22%3Cp%20style%3D%5C%22white-space%3A%20pre-wrap%3B%5C%22%3E%E7%BD%AE%E6%8D%A2%E7%A9%BA%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%88%E6%A6%82%E7%8E%87%E5%88%B7%E5%87%BA%EF%BC%89%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D%5D%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1711022438825\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"info\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--info obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h1>武器数据</h1> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__info-table\"><colgroup><col> <col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-avatar\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/07/77124895/d06885d9acee7e27fa4d7927d898b665_3869830697142625634.png\" alt=\"\"></td> <td class=\"h3\">星级</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-stars\"><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">攻击</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">275</td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">会心</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">29</td></tr></tbody></table> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-desc\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">它仿佛是用「 优雅 」与「 神秘 」铸就而成的，和它现在的主人一样拥有着举手投足间颠倒众生的魔性。亲眼目睹过它真容的人往往为它的美丽而失神，却不知晓它已失落在神话时代的残酷异名——「 夺魂者 」</p></div> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器技能</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">夺魂者</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">[能量消耗:0][冷却:30秒]令失落迷迭直接进入【冥府魔女】形态，并在自身周围释放一圈夺魂迷雾，造成200%攻击力雷电元素伤害。身陷迷雾的敌人会陷入【失魂】状态，【蛇之印】的周期性雷电对【失魂】状态的敌人额外造成50.0%攻击力雷电元素伤害，持续5秒。每次使用蓄力攻击，自身全伤害提升15.0%，持续5秒（ 该效果无法叠加 ）。</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">安息香</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">角色蓄力攻击和必杀技造成的雷电元素伤害提升15.0%，全队对处于【恶戏咒纹】的敌人全伤害增加15.0%（ 该效果唯一生效 )</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"gainMethod\" data-tmpl=\"general\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-general obc-tmpl__part--gainMethod obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>获取方式</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">补给获取</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">精准补给、活动补给</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">大伟哥别墅</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">消耗<a href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1180/detail\" data-type=\"obc-content\" target=\"_blank\">大伟哥黑金卡</a>兑换获得</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">「迷迭花坊」(限时)</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">消耗4000武器共鸣兑换获得</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">作战凭证</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">第十七（V4.9）、第二十三期（V5.5）作战工坊限时兑换</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">材料-消耗品</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">开启<a href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1814/detail\" data-type=\"obc-content\" target=\"_blank\">武器自选箱</a>兑换获得</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">置换空间</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">置换空间（概率刷出）</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl obc-tmpl--col-l2r1\" data-data=\"%5B%7B%22tmplKey%22%3A%22general%22%2C%22partKey%22%3A%22material%22%2C%22data%22%3A%7B%22layout_%22%3A%22banner%22%2C%22list%22%3A%5B%7B%22level%22%3A%2235%22%2C%22material%22%3A%5B%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E4%B8%89%E5%88%86%E7%